(7497184, 1194445, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Cor blimey Drake, you produce a lovely image like this, a 6+ score and 7th place and NO comments? You really have got your wildlife images well nailed, this gorgeous splash of detailed colour against the near mono background of the driving snow, it almost looks like a post-processing desat but I dont believe it is. The composition is good, I like the diagonal of the twig and that there is a little more space to the right for the bird to look into. What I like most is the snow that is slowly building up around the beak, as you say, the snow was really coming down. Anyway, well done, a lovely image justly rewarded, I hope this critique makes up for the lack of comments.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Cor blimey Drake, you produce a lovely image like this, a 6+ score and 7th place and NO comments? You really have got your wildlife images well nailed, this gorgeous splash of detailed colour against the near mono background of the driving snow, it almost looks like a post-processing desat but I dont believe it is. The composition is good, I like the diagonal of the twig and that there is a little more space to the right for the bird to look into. What I like most is the snow that is slowly building up around the beak, as you say, the snow was really coming down. Anyway, well done, a lovely image justly rewarded, I hope this critique makes up for the lack of comments.', '2017-02-06 05:24:01.000000', NULL, 0),
